    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verde is a cozy city management game with a focus on nature. Build houses for the seedlets, fulfill their demands, and watch them fill your town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build houses, fulfill their demands, attract population, build more houses! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/12b11634a1c6e4e70e3e59396a53b433.poster.avif?t=1753417014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/12b11634a1c6e4e70e3e59396a53b433.webm?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/12b11634a1c6e4e70e3e59396a53b433.mp4?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize the look of your town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your own spin to the look of the town with<strong> </strong>various cute designs, perfect to enjoy while chilling down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/cc713cf6094551bd2a5ae715f06a1fa8.poster.avif?t=1753417014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/cc713cf6094551bd2a5ae715f06a1fa8.webm?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/cc713cf6094551bd2a5ae715f06a1fa8.mp4?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the different regions of Dewdrop Valley!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and build the unique regions of Dewdrop Valley. Each region comes with it's own unique look and challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/b0086494fb7b946f349a083e5a2d67f2.poster.avif?t=1753417014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/b0086494fb7b946f349a083e5a2d67f2.webm?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/b0086494fb7b946f349a083e5a2d67f2.mp4?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Verde is a cozy city management game with a focus on nature. Build houses for the seedlets, fulfill their demands, and watch them fill your town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build the town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build houses, fulfill their demands, attract population, build more houses! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/12b11634a1c6e4e70e3e59396a53b433.poster.avif?t=1753417014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/12b11634a1c6e4e70e3e59396a53b433.webm?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/12b11634a1c6e4e70e3e59396a53b433.mp4?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize the look of your town!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your own spin to the look of the town with<strong> </strong>various cute designs, perfect to enjoy while chilling down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/cc713cf6094551bd2a5ae715f06a1fa8.poster.avif?t=1753417014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/cc713cf6094551bd2a5ae715f06a1fa8.webm?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/cc713cf6094551bd2a5ae715f06a1fa8.mp4?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the different regions of Dewdrop Valley!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and build the unique regions of Dewdrop Valley. Each region comes with it's own unique look and challenges to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/b0086494fb7b946f349a083e5a2d67f2.poster.avif?t=1753417014\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/b0086494fb7b946f349a083e5a2d67f2.webm?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164310/extras/b0086494fb7b946f349a083e5a2d67f2.mp4?t=1753417014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
